Maintainer: David Henke <davidmhenke@gmail.com>
Description: Extending the 'glmnet' by implementing a biologically informed extension of the Least Absolute Shrinkage and Selection Operator (LASSO) regression framework that incorporates protein-protein interaction (PPI) network data into the regularization penalty. Designed for high-dimensional biomarker discovery in precision oncology contexts, particularly using DepMap dependency and copy number variation data.
